The public single header retains its original zlib license and notices.
LICENSE is the upstream license file. This is an altered distribution.

Local changes:
- Native C library includes, raymath9 float adapters and library pragmas.
  The implementation is compiled once into libraygui.a using 6c and mk.
- Text boxes drain the character queue each frame, preserving UTF-8 code
  points, the terminating NUL and the caller's buffer capacity.
- Clipboard insertion moves only the suffix and its terminating NUL,
  avoiding reads before the buffer when pasting near its start.
- Color pickers always draw their hue bar when the color panel changes,
  preserving the change result from either control. Adapted from upstream
  raygui.h at 9cb5cfa73290ba920d071f57c1d06a4daee22f52, where the hue call
  was likewise separated from the conditional color-panel update.

The native build, tests and modelview client use the generated9 root LICENSE.
Tested with the native raylib 6.0 port and its classic OpenGL backend.
